What is Shared Library:
-----------------------

    - jenkins shared library = reusable pipeline code stored in a version control system (like Github)
    - used by multiple pipeline/projects by just referencing it
    - write pipeline code once --> reuse everywhere


    why shared library:
    -------------------
        Without shared library:
            - same pipeline code repeated in multiple projects
            - hard to maintain
            - duplicate code

        With shared library:
            - reusable code
            - centralized management
            - easy updates
            - used across teams & projects



